    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94534" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκαμβ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>crooked, bent</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ς. ξύλον
				οὐδέποτ᾽ ὀρθόν</span> 'there's no straightening a
				<i>crooked</i> billet', <i><span class="en">
				Macar.
				7.69
			</span></i>; of a cow's horns, dub. rest. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>PBaden</u>
				19.5
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>; esp. <i>bent asunder, bow</i>, of the
			legs, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βλαισός</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gp.</u>
				19.2.1
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.793
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hippiatr.</u>
				102
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρδία ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				100(101).3
			</span></i>.</div>
